       "html": "Izan bedi <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒇</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⊂</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒂</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒃</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow></math>. <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒙</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒂</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒇</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒙</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒃</mi></mrow></math> dela esaten da: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∃</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒙</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">∥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒙</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒂</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">∥</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">∥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒇</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒙</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒃</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">∥</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
