     "html": "Atal honetan <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⊂</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi></mrow></math> diferentziagarria da <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></math> puntuan (<math display=\"inline\"><mi>A</mi></math> irekia)."
