     "html": "Nahiz eta errotazionala soilik <math display=\"inline\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>-ko eremu bektorialetarako definiturik egon, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math>  <math display=\"inline\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>-ko eremu bektoriala bada, identifika daiteke <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math> espazioko eremu bektorialarekin eta definitu errotazionala honela: <img class=\"formula formula-d\" src=\"media/formulak/4687202ca17244d0.svg\" alt=\"rot bold(F) = rot(P,Q,0) = (0,0,(partial Q)/(partial x)-(partial P)/(partial y)).\" style=\"width:21.048em;height:2.980em\" loading=\"lazy\"> Orduan, berridatz dezakegu Greenen teorema honela:"
