       "html": "Izan bitez <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⊂</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math> Greenen teoremaren hipotesia betetzen duen multzoa, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>∂</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></math> bere muga eta <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>  <math display=\"inline\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math> klaseko eremu bektoriala. Orduan <img class=\"formula formula-d\" src=\"media/formulak/d557f0a742dcfd41.svg\" alt=\"integral_(partial D) bold(F) dot dif s = integral.double_D rot bold(F) dot hat(k) dif x dif y.\" style=\"width:16.367em;height:3.031em\" loading=\"lazy\">"
