     "blokeak": [
      {
       "mota": "testua",
       "html": "Izan bedi <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></math> eremu bektoriala. <img class=\"formula\" src=\"media/formulak/fffef99cf2d0ea57.svg\" alt=\"rot bold(F)=0\" style=\"width:4.979em;height:1.001em\" loading=\"lazy\"> bada, orduan <math display=\"inline\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi></math>  <strong>irrotazionala</strong> dela diogu."
      }
     ]
